WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.213
This work sharply analyzes the test error of
finite-rank kernel ridge regression,

00:00:05.293 --> 00:00:08.742
the model behind tuning a frozen network's last layer.

00:00:08.822 --> 00:00:14.100
It derives matching upper and lower bounds that
stay tight for any regularization.
